4
00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:06.149
<i>"Is there a change that I can make
in my life right now</i>

5
00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.194
<i>to become the best version of myself?</i>

6
00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:12.071
<i>Who do I wanna be?"</i>

7
00:01:12.072 --> 00:01:13.447
What is the life that I wanna have?

8
00:01:13.448 --> 00:01:15.826
What is the face
that I wanna present to the world?

9
00:01:17.995 --> 00:01:20.622
These are the kinds of questions
that keep you up at night.

10
00:01:21.206 --> 00:01:24.959
And when you're behind the wheel of
a high-performance automobile like this,

11
00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.836
no one asks those questions.

12
00:01:26.837 --> 00:01:29.380
They know you are that guy.

13
00:01:29.381 --> 00:01:31.300
